ont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI下调GPT-5.6 Luna模型价格80%，性价比反超DeepSeek V4 Pro</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta升级AI推荐系统利用LLM分析帖子内容，推动Instagram用户时长增长</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google 用 AI 单月修复上千 Chrome 漏洞，超越过去两年总和</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果暗示Siri AI将引入付费限制，重度用户或需订阅iCloud+服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f89da2b05fd954225759c0feaa725357.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果CEO蒂姆·库克在财报电话会议中首次暗示，Siri AI未来将引入付费模式，高频使用该功能的用户可能需要订阅iCloud+。苹果指出，Siri AI背后依赖的云端计算资源及大语言模型运行成本高昂，因此计划对免费使用设置额度限制。除Siri AI外，苹果已明确部分Apple Intelligence功能将采用分级策略，如照片应用的“清理”与“扩展”功能、图像游乐场、家庭App的AI视频录制及快捷指令的Cloud Pro模型，均将根据iCloud+订阅等级提供不同额度。搭载Siri AI的iOS 27预计于今年晚些时候发布，支持iPhone 15 Pro及后续机型和支持Apple Intelligence的Mac设备。受监管因素影响，该功能短期内暂不登陆欧洲及中国大陆市场。苹果正通过此举探索AI能力的商业化路径</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">华为开源5050亿参数openPangu-2.0-Pro模型，同步开放权重与推理代码</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f1f85c532c0ad732a03080f5fb222ddb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">华为正式开源openPangu-2.0-Pro大模型，同步向开发者开放模型权重、基础推理代码及技术报告。该模型是openPangu 2.0开源计划的核心组件，采用混合专家（MoE）架构，总参数规模达505B，每Token激活参数为18B。在性能参数方面，该模型支持512K上下文长度，训练数据规模约34T Tokens。后训练阶段通过快慢合一SFT、多专项强化学习及在线蒸馏（OPD）技术实现能力融合。华为强调，该模型基于昇腾NPU训练，旨在通过优化时延与吞吐率提升推理效率。此次开源不仅是华为推进昇腾AI生态建设的重要举措，也为国产大模型研发提供了基于昇腾原生训练与推理技术的最佳实践参考。此前，92B参数的openPangu-2.0-Flash已于6月30日率先开源。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI下调GPT-5.6 Luna模型价格80%，性价比反超DeepSeek V4 Pro</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式发布GPT-5.6系列定价调整方案，针对Terra与Luna两款中轻量级模型实施降价，旗舰模型Sol价格保持不变。其中，Luna模型输入与输出费用同步下调80%，调整后每百万输入Token价格降至0.2美元，输出降至1.2美元。Terra模型价格同步下调20%。根据Artificial Analysis评测数据，降价后的Luna在通用文本创作、多轮对话及工具调用等场景中，综合性价比已全面超越DeepSeek V4 Pro。此次调价旨在通过“低价Luna抢市场、高端Sol保利润”的策略，补齐此前海外模型在成本端的短板，直接应对国产大模型在平价API市场的竞争压力。业内认为，随着国产模型低价护城河被打破，大模型行业竞争将进入新阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta升级AI推荐系统利用LLM分析帖子内容，推动Instagram用户时长增长</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9612b816efd0660f7728d1ff0799620b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta在2026年第二季度财报中披露，通过升级AI推荐系统，Instagram用户使用时长实现两位数增长。Meta利用大型语言模型（LLM）对Reels和Feed中的公开帖子进行语义、主题及情绪分析，并结合Muse模型进行视频分类与摘要，从而实现比传统点击信号更精准的个性化推荐。此次Reels排序算法升级使整体会话量提升15个基点，并显著提高了视频分享率与观看时长。Meta计划将该推荐框架扩展至Facebook主信息流。尽管AI驱动的推荐策略提升了商业效率与内容触达，但Meta正面临美国20多个州关于青少年沉迷问题的诉讼，相关法律支出已达24亿美元。如何在生成式AI深度融入社交平台的同时，平衡个性化体验、商业增长与用户健康，已成为行业核心挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google 用 AI 单月修复上千 Chrome 漏洞，超越过去两年总和</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6908788111d144011217c172eefd50c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google 用 AI 单月修复上千 Chrome 漏洞，超越过去两年总和AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jul 31, 202631Google 近日公布的数据堪称震撼：在 AI 工具辅助下，仅 6 月推出的 Chrome 149 与 Chrome 150 两个版本中，团队就修复了多达 1072 个安全漏洞。作为对比，过去两年发行的 23 个 Chrome 版本累计修复漏洞总数仅为 1036 个——AI 让漏洞发现与修复的效率发生了质变。Gemini 入场，漏洞挖掘进入工业化时代 Chrome 工程总监道格·特纳直言，大语言模型已经从根本上改变了网络安全的经济格局，将漏洞发现转化为自动化、工业化规模的操作。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
